  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prevention, protection and assistance to vulnerable survivors of human trafficking, 2025-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project goal is to raise awareness about human trafficking among Caritas staff and other care givers and to increase capacities to protect the most vulnerable survivors of human trafficking in Ukraine.

The objectives are:
1.	Screening and identification of the survivors among the vulnerable population. 
2.	Comprehensive and tailor made assistance to the survivors and their family members.
3.	Conducting training of trainers (ToT) for project staff and trainings for all Caritas network staff.
4.	Prevention of human trafficking, with focus on children, youth, their parents and guardians.</narrative>
  </description>
